# Whitebook local configuration.
# One project-wide licensed Desmos API key for the graphing calculator. The
# key is client-visible by design but is excluded from source control, logs,
# diagnostic output, and backups. Leave empty to run without Desmos.
WHITEBOOK_DESMOS_API_KEY=

# The one global Reference Sheet is a single user-provided PNG resolved inside
# the data directory, e.g. <data dir>\assets\reference-sheet.png.
